{"id":"c1f2dd6e09b632ce596bbd44","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/08/senior-managers-at-st-basils-aged-care-where-50-died-from-covid-cant-remember-it-all-grieving-loved-ones-cant-forget","published_at":"2026-08-08T00:00:30Z","collected_at":"2026-08-08T00:34:17.531475Z","title":"Senior managers at St Basil’s aged care, where 50 died from Covid, can’t remember it all. Grieving loved ones can’t forget","text":"Almost a quarter of the 188 residents at St Basil’s aged care home died from Covid-19 or neglect during July and August 2020. Photograph: James Ross/AAP View image in fullscreen Almost a quarter of the 188 residents at St Basil’s aged care home died from Covid-19 or neglect during July and August 2020. Photograph: James Ross/AAP Coronavirus Senior managers at St Basil’s aged care, where 50 died from Covid, can’t remember it all. Grieving loved ones can’t forget Konstantin Kontis and Vicky Kos were compelled to testify at a coronial inquest resuming on the sixth anniversary of the tragedy Get our breaking news email , free app or daily news podcast Melissa Davey Medical editor Fri 7 Aug 2026 20.00 EDT Last modified on Fri 7 Aug 2026 20.01 EDT Share Prefer the Guardian on Google Quiet sobs could be heard in Melbourne’s coroner’s court, as several families attended to finally hear from the pair who were the most senior managers when, throughout July and August 2020, almost a quarter of the 188 residents at St Basil’s aged care home died from Covid-19 or neglect . Following multiple failed legal bids to avoid giving evidence after 50 residents died in the Victorian aged care home they ","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/e38e3fb0cbf90a25b97c7a25e642872c20325a42/450_0_4539_3633/master/4539.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none","https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/6e7916b183617e93f592785979439f52e2705a95/0_0_4400_3013/master/4400.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none","https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/715eeaea8748ed2b50893a71318401e5d4de20ec/0_0_3000_2000/master/3000.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none","https://media.guim.co.uk/10b4e02333ee97ecf51d5e814fd324a88832fb17/1177_0_2998_3000/2998.jpg"],"author":"Melissa Davey Medical editor","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"0c1b6f120d0504f6d4cc6c3d5029a75c7d664f17f4fcdfcdaf5cdab41b4c92f7","original_text_chars":10724,"original_html_chars":36371,"text_truncated":true,"media_count":4,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/08/senior-managers-at-st-basils-aged-care-where-50-died-from-covid-cant-remember-it-all-grieving-loved-ones-cant-forget","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/08/senior-managers-at-st-basils-aged-care-where-50-died-from-covid-cant-remember-it-all-grieving-loved-ones-cant-forget"}}}
{"id":"49ea508a720baf723ae508b5","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/07/utah-wildfire-helicopter-crash","published_at":"2026-08-08T00:12:32Z","collected_at":"2026-08-08T00:34:31.939932Z","title":"Helicopter fighting Utah wildfire crashes with two people onboard, officials say","text":"The Widemouth 2 wildfire burning near Richfield, Utah. Photograph: U.S. Forest Service/Fishlake National Fores/AP View image in fullscreen The Widemouth 2 wildfire burning near Richfield, Utah. Photograph: U.S. Forest Service/Fishlake National Fores/AP US news Helicopter fighting Utah wildfire crashes with two people onboard, officials say Rescuers not yet able to reach scene of crash near Richfield in central Utah, prompting fears for two missing people Uwa Ede-Osifo Fri 7 Aug 2026 20.12 EDT Last modified on Fri 7 Aug 2026 20.14 EDT Share Prefer the Guardian on Google A firefighting Sikorsky S64 helicopter with two individuals onboard crashed on Friday morning in central Utah , according to federal aviation authorities. The US Forest Service initially declined to comment on the condition of the helicopter’s passengers, asking the public for “patience while we focus on response efforts” in a statement . Emergency personnel are responding near Richfield, a city about 160 miles south of Salt Lake City, an agency spokesperson told the Guardian by email. The exact circumstances surrounding the crash are unknown. At a media briefing on Friday evening, Tyler Hecht, deputy incident comman","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/033018722b587dba777d4f74f193c6e2f60e2b8a/0_0_2048_1365/master/2048.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none"],"author":"Uwa Ede-Osifo","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"bc07709812ebe507700ba253a5107e109b1597ba8860c3601b7a4c3cba374122","original_text_chars":2370,"original_html_chars":12604,"text_truncated":true,"media_count":1,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/07/utah-wildfire-helicopter-crash","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/07/utah-wildfire-helicopter-crash"}}}
{"id":"ba39ab04d782489fc6aaae63","source":"colonelcassad-tg","source_name":"Boris Rozhin","platform":"telegram","url":"https://t.me/boris_rozhin/221311","published_at":"2026-08-08T00:03:01Z","collected_at":"2026-08-08T00:34:02.936136Z","title":"","text":"⠀ 🔴 Доказательства зверств киевского режима в г. Димитров (ДНР). Смотреть на Rutube Смотреть предыдущие свидетельства Наш Международный общественный трибунал по преступлениям украинских неонацистов (председатель — М. С. Григорьев ) из представителей гражданского общества 35 стран мира продолжает сбор свидетельств преступлений киевского режима. Часть 1 Часть 2. Жительница г. Димитров (ДНР) Надежда Остапец: 00:00 \"Украинские военные нас ненавидели. Постоянно угрожали, говорили: \"Мы вас всё равно убьём. Вы здесь не жильцы. Зачем вам свет, покойникам?\". Говорили, что разрушат всё, даже собачьи будки. 00:45 Они разрушали город. Уничтожили шахты. Украинский дрон долго кружил над городом, искал, где собирались люди. Уничтожили рынок. Они выкладывали видео в интернет, рассказывали, что уже уничтожили и что планируют разбомбить. 01:22 Мы приехали на рынок за покупками. Увидели, как дрон кружит над рынком, и люди начали прятаться под навесами и ларьками. Потом он полетел к магазину возле рынка, где стояла очередь, и ударил прямо по людям. Одному человеку оторвало руку. Погибли три человека, ещё около пяти получили ранения. 02:34 Позже люди стояли в очереди за хлебом. Это было уже после того,","html":"","media":["https://cdn4.telesco.pe/file/A4Ekp0uJwvbPCwKNILLAXuQP0K4AwtKsY-YVFkt4XACBVysYO87uRvSQPZkOgVXcdFQjENoKjFiWqoBYHbq7dX4aQYwlPWBMar40tsOTeWpjW3_yKSjjsg40vxY6RhTPYQ0VG0fl4dg1I0yoCKII7v-vXnchySUfm8Fy5Alc8UpKZTCAsqIiL4jsWzK-kQx8XYNzSFsdkU7d9oJ69K_9uo-Mt8mKPNr9BhFo9XsofNzvwLPJyjp95l6fv-xwClFKkbpugqUlXiGP9Mvw-AmmiHiLchtaLRSwgJLAbCj6EhrCvJu0s5qQ1LeHbE-JrmVaHSCjxacnEvK7faopJc08Lg","https://rutube.ru/video/60814d4685138c99cc5fa6bad272ef93/"],"author":"Boris Rozhin","language":"und","group":"ru-milbloggers","perspective":"russi